    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280071</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>プロテクトリングを渡しますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Give them a Protect Ring?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うっわー、
また来たよ、
こいつら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Woooow.
They came.
They're here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よっぽど、
物が欲しいだすね、物が。
物欲の塊だす～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yew really want a prize, don't
yew. Yew want it so bad. Ye just
a big lump of want, want, want.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どんどん、
本心が出てきてるね、
こりゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They're really starting to
let the mask slip, huh.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278276</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちっちぇーことは、
気にすんなってよ。
丸出しねぇちゃん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't mind the little
things, ya naked girlie.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んだんだ、
ありじごく様は、
どんなヤツらにも平等だすよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And well, the Great Antlion
Pit's just as fair to anyone
and everyone, even yew.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さてさて、今回、我々が頂く……、
じゃなくて、ありじごく様に、
交換をお願いする品物は……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So let's see, this time, we'll be
receiving...err, I mean, the Great
Antlion Pit will exchange for us...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ざざーん！
プロテクトリングですね。
アクセサリーどぇ～す</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ta-dah! Protect Ring!
Y'know, that accessory
thingie.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほれ、ジャンプしてみろだす。
チャラチャラいってるの
サッサと出すだすよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, let's hop to it already.
Cut all this chit-chat and
hand it over!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いい加減、
これも飽きてきたなぁ……。
ふー、やるか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y'know, I'm pretty
bored of this now.
Mehh, let's get it done.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だべよ？　だべか？
そうだべか？？？
ごって、わくわく～～～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is it? Isn't it? It is, isn't it?
Aaalrighty, so exciting~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こいつらの、悪態、
どんどんひどくなってるな…</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They're really just getting
more insulting as we go, huh.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だぁーってろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ya caught on?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うるさいだすよ。
ほら、いくだすよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yew should shut it.
We're doing it now!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マジで？　ジーマー？
本気の本気で？？？
ガス、ガスガス、ガス！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really? For realsies?
Truthfully truly?? Vroom,
vroom vroom, vroom!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇ、ひょっとして、
ボクたちが渡した物、
そのまま……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, so do you think,
maybe everything we've
given them is just...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ん！　んな、バカなこと、
あるわけねぇだすよ！
バカ言っちゃいけねぇだすよ！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh!? Stop saying such stupid
shit! Of course not! Stop running
ye stupid yap already!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あー、もーもー、モー！
ちゃんと、来てますよ。
こちらの方に</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aaah, for frick's sake!
Alright, it's coming up,
uh, right over here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい、どんぞ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right, here ya are.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おめぇ、こりゃー、
さっき後ろ向いてる時に
こそこそなんかして……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, you. Ya didn't, well, when
ya had your back turned,
just sneakily pull out a little...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そそそ、ボクちんの
搾りたて、ギューピュピュって。
ぐふふふ～～～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right, exactly. I just tugged
on myself a bit and, like,
spurt spurt spurt. Gahahaha~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんか、もう
疲れるね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm kind of
tired of this...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んだよ。
ダメ人間どもが。
早く用意しろよな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The hell? You worthless
freakin' humans. Just get
us the goods already.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
